      "description": "暖白页面上的深绿阅读入口；直接跳到价值列表。",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-primary\" href=\"#story\">它能帮我做什么<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a>",
      "css": ".ds-primary{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:18px;font-family:\"Microsoft YaHei\",\"PingFang SC\",system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;padding:15px 23px;min-height:62px;text-decoration:none;border-radius:4px;background:var(--green,#344f42);color:var(--paper,#fafaf7)}.ds-primary:hover{background:#233d2e}.ds-primary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#a75420);outline-offset:5px}.ds-primary svg{width:24px;height:24px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.6;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}"
    },
    {
      "name": "章节导航",
      "kind": "nav",
      "description": "三项阅读锚点；680px 以下在品牌后独立一行。",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"文档章节\"><a href=\"#self\">怎么写</a><a href=\"#time\">怎么看变化</a><a href=\"#together\">怎么交流</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;gap:28px;font-family:\"Microsoft YaHei\",\"PingFang SC\",system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--ink,#2b342d)}.ds-nav a{font-size:20px;padding-block:10px;text-decoration:none;color:inherit;text-underline-offset:6px}.ds-nav a:hover{text-decoration:underline}.ds-nav a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#a75420);outline-offset:5px}@media(max-width:680px){.ds-nav{width:100%;gap:0;justify-content:space-between;border-top:1px solid var(--line,#d4dbcf);padding-top:8px}.ds-nav a{font-size:18px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "分享模式切换",
