      "refersTo": "share-switch",
      "description": "切换邀请与答案分享的真实截图，以 aria-pressed 与底色表达状态。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-sharing-switch\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"选择分享示意\"><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\">只发问题</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">分享答案</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-sharing-switch{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-block:23px 14px}.ds-sharing-switch button{font-family:\"Microsoft YaHei\",\"PingFang SC\",system-ui,sans-serif;background:transparent;color:var(--ink,#2b342d);border:1px solid #a7b69d;padding:11px 18px;font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;border-radius:4px;cursor:pointer}.ds-sharing-switch button:hover{background:#d9e2d0}.ds-sharing-switch button[aria-pressed=\"true\"]{background:var(--green,#344f42);border-color:var(--green,#344f42);color:var(--paper,#fafaf7)}.ds-sharing-switch button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#a75420);outline-offset:5px}@media(max-width:680px){.ds-sharing-switch button{padding-inline:16px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "依据展开区",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "原生 details 按需显示产品依据与虚构说明。",
      "html": "<details class=\"ds-sources\"><summary>产品依据与范例说明</summary><div><p>案例经节选、缩写，不是用户证言；图片为 AI 场景创作。交互内容为提案示意，非应用截图。</p></div></details>",
      "css": ".ds-sources{font-family:\"Microsoft YaHei\",\"PingFang SC\",system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--ink,#2b342d);border-top:1px solid var(--line,#d4dbcf);padding-top:20px;margin-top:25px}.ds-sources summary{font-size:18px;line-height:1.8;cursor:pointer}.ds-sources>div{padding-top:18px}.ds-sources p{font-size:18px;line-height:1.85;margin:0}.ds-sources summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#a75420);outline-offset:5px}"
    },
